  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to see a raycast component for avatars that will make the affected object instantly and seamlessly follow the terrain. Ideally, the raycast would be projected from a specified axis, have a configurable maximum range, and could have integrations with animators (distance int, hasCollided bool). This would be more effective in situations where the rigidbody launcher prefab from vrlabs would be used. For me personally as an avid creator of military avatars, I would personally use this for laser designators for airstrikes though I bet there are a lot of other fun and interesting applications for this as well.",
